{"id": 7365, "raw": "<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quick links</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://cal.com/matteocigala/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Book a catch-up call</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.vivifysports.com/nutritionalcoaching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nutrition consult with Marine</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/353834777697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp Matteo</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.skool.com/cigala-cycling-collective-1115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Community on Skool</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The Skool community is free for coaching clients. No invitation yet? <a href=\"mailto:matteo@cigalacycling.com?subject=Skool%20invitation\">Email me</a> and I will send it (please check your spam folder too, sometimes it ends up there).</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your training apps</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your plan is in Vekta and syncs to your Garmin, Wahoo or Zwift.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.joinvekta.com/me/calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Open my Vekta calendar</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Share your rides</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Proud of a session? Share it and tag us, we love seeing your work.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Open the <b>Vekta app</b> and tap a session you’ve done.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Tap <b>Share</b> (top right) and pick Instagram, Facebook or wherever you post.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Tag <b>@cigalacycling</b>. We’ll share the best ones.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cigalacycling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CigalaCycling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Facebook</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cigalacycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TikTok</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@cigalacycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">YouTube</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>Follow us for training tips, rider stories and race weeks.</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Training library</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strength and core</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7373,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7373\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7373\">Stretches &amp; Core</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7373\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7374,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7374\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7374\">Gym Circuit: Winter, first month</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7374\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7375,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7375\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7375\">Gym Circuit: Winter, second and third month</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7375\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7376,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7376\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7376\">Gym Circuit: In season</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7376\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nutrition, with Marine Lenehan</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7377,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7377\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7377\">Nutritional Guide</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7377\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7378,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7378\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7378\">Supplement List</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7378\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Video routines</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:html --><div class=\"ath-video\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600\">Core &amp; Strength Routine</p><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#000\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/videoseries?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0WTgEJlbBZpJXFOjgDktpnz&amp;rel=0\" title=\"Core &amp; Strength Routine\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0WTgEJlbBZpJXFOjgDktpnz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open on YouTube ↗</a></p></div><!-- /wp:html --><!-- wp:html --><div class=\"ath-video\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600\">Stretch Routine</p><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#000\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/videoseries?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0VdvMQZYo-Qaxv6Ual0Fbm7&amp;rel=0\" title=\"Stretch Routine\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0VdvMQZYo-Qaxv6Ual0Fbm7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open on YouTube ↗</a></p></div><!-- /wp:html --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Training tools</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"ath-tools\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons ath-tools\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/carbs-per-hour-calculator/\">Carbs per hour</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/critical-power-calculator/\">Critical Power</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/sweat-rate-calculator/\">Sweat rate</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/climb-time-calculator/\">Climb time</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/gear-speed-calculator/\">Gear &amp; speed</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" h